35	
36	┌─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┐
37	│ 2. PROVIDE TASKS (The Triplet Focus Queue)                                  │
38	│ GET /api/v1/golden-hour/esp32/queue?limit=3&tasklist_id=all                 │
39	│ • Reads from local Disk D:\ in < 2ms without network overhead.              │
40	│ • Returns top 3 tasks formatted for OLED / TFT display.                     │
41	└─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┘
42	
43	┌─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┐
44	│ 3. MARK TASK AS DONE (Instant Local + Async Background Patch)               │
45	│ POST /api/v1/golden-hour/google-tasks/complete                              │
46	│ • Local cache updated in < 1ms -> Returns success to ESP32 immediately.    │
47	│ • Single background thread patches Google Cloud (zero backend freezing).    │
48	└─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┘
49	```
